OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,6,Fsome sunny intervals. A mainly dry
OL,7,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,9,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers becoming more
OL,12,Fisolated this evening and tonight with
OL,13,Fsome clear spells, but cloudier by
OL,14,Fmorning with further showers. Windy.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,17,Fshowers, some heavy. Fresh to strong
OL,18,Fwesterly winds. Drier by evening. On
OL,19,Fthe cool side.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
